4382:          <h3 id="function-design-m08-08-m08-08_admin_customer_customer_manual_mail-手動メールを送信する-POST-admin-route-customer-manual-mail-customerId-templateId">手動メールを送信する（POST <code>/{admin_route}/customer/manual_mail/{customerId}/{templateId}</code>）</h3>
